      "parameters": {
        "content": "## QuantumTrade OmniRoute Research (Webhook)\n\n**Base:** `https://omni.allikas.online`\n**Auth:** credential **OmniRoute Trading v3** (`OmniRtTradV3n801`) httpBearerAuth\n\n### Model routing (Trading v3)\n- **kie/*** offline for Trading v3 \u2014 do NOT pin kie ids\n- **TRIAGE/speed:** `auto/fast`\n- **DEEP/quality:** `auto/best-chat`\n\n### Enrichment (QT creds)\n- Tavily Search QT \u2192 `Tavily account QT`\n- SerpAPI News QT \u2192 `SerpAPI QT HTTP`\n- Jina Search QT \u2192 `Jina AI`\n- Firecrawl Direct QT \u2192 `Firecrawl QT`\n- CMC Quotes QT \u2192 `CMC QT` (market context)\n- OmniRoute Brave/Firecrawl/Chat stay on OmniRoute Trading v3\n- Apify not wired (no news actor configured)\n\n\n### Scrapling\nTop brief URL fetched via `http://ai-trading-scrapling:8080/fetch` (cred Scrapling QT) before chat.",
